From: X710 mainline port <bringup@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: select the Fedora X710 charging source port

Keep the existing diagnostic driver separately selectable. The new source port
uses same-model continuous ADC/PPS policy with conservative X710 integration.
Default n; direct charging remains opt-in and off at probe.

--- a/drivers/power/supply/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/Kconfig
@@ -1240 +1240,9 @@
+config CHARGER_SM5440_FEDORA
+	bool "Samsung X710 Fedora SM5440 charging source port"
+	depends on I2C && OF && BATTERY_SM5714=y && TYPEC_SM5714=y
+	depends on !CHARGER_SM5440_DIRECT
+	help
+	  Same-model Fedora continuous ADC, PPS and charge-pump worker.
+	  Direct charging defaults off; use an explicitly registered candidate.
+
 endif # POWER_SUPPLY
--- a/drivers/power/supply/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/power/supply/Makefile
@@ -145,0 +146 @@
+obj-$(CONFIG_CHARGER_SM5440_FEDORA) += sm5440-fedora.o
